**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.orig
proptest-regressions/*.txt.orig

# dubu-updater runtime state: the killswitch latch, written wherever `risk.state_path` points.
# Committing it would ship one machine's halt decision to every other, and a commit that reset
# it would silently resume a halted book — which is the one thing the latch exists to prevent.
/state/
